    contribution: >-
      Criteria engineering (the three directions of auditing one's own criteria, 88
      criteria, 8 of them proven able to fail); the blind-replication driver and its
      strict parser; regression-gate steps 5-8 (criteria fingerprints, frozen-file
      hashes, release-metadata consistency, counterexample re-run); package
      construction; and the written record of every self-correction, including the
      ones that were wrong twice.
